The MIT license covers the source code. The threat data in src/data/ is
built from third-party sources and keeps their own licenses:

- trackers.json: Exodus Privacy, ODbL 1.0 / DbCL 1.0
  https://reports.exodus-privacy.eu.org
- malware-packages.json: stalkerware-indicators (CC BY 4.0,
  https://github.com/AssoEchap/stalkerware-indicators) and mvt-indicators
  (MIT, https://github.com/mvt-project/mvt-indicators)
- apk-hashes.bin: MalwareBazaar by abuse.ch, terms of use
  https://bazaar.abuse.ch/faq/#tos
- uad.json: package names and removal levels from UAD-ng (GPL-3.0,
  https://github.com/Universal-Debloater-Alliance/universal-android-debloater-next-generation)
